<title>PAKISTAN: Port conditions update - Lloyds Shipping.</title>
<headline>Port conditions update - Lloyds Shipping.</headline>
<text>
<p>Port conditions from Lloyds Shipping Intelligence Service --</p>
<p>PAKISTAN, Karachi, Nov 12 -- Vessels waiting off port - one general cargo, waiting for one day, two containers, first vessel waiting for one day, one iron/scrap, waiting for three days, one loader, waiting for two days, and three oil tankers, first vessel waiting for four days. Four vessels laid up off port for own reasons.</p>
</text>
